of_use_n_nprivacy_policy_n_n1_data_collection_n_dmarketalert_does_not_collect_personal_information_such_as_n_name_n_phone_number_n_email_address_n_passwords_n_financial_data_n_the_app_may_use_the_following_data_n_user_created_targets_n_item_price_information_n_technical_logs_api_delays_error_messages_n_none_of_this_data_can_identify_a_specific_person_n_2_data_usage_n_all_collected_or_generated_data_is_used_only_for_n_sending_local_notifications_n_displaying_targets_and_history_n_performing_background_price_monitoring_n_your_data_is_not_sold_shared_or_transferred_to_third_parties_n_3_data_storage_n_target_data_may_be_stored_n_locally_on_the_user_s_device_n_or_if_enabled_by_the_user_on_a_monitoring_server_managed_by_the_backend_developer_n_no_confidential_personal_information_is_stored_n_4_security_n_we_apply_basic_security_measures_including_n_https_for_api_communication_n_no_advertising_sdks_n_no_analytics_trackers_or_third_party_data_collectors_n_5_dmarket_api_usage_n_the_application_accesses_dmarket_data_only_through_allowed_public_or_authorized_api_methods_n_we_do_not_access_user_accounts_balances_or_private_trading_information_n_6_data_sharing_n_no_data_is_shared_with_external_organizations_advertisers_or_analytics_services_n_7_user_rights_n_users_can_n_delete_their_targets_n_clear_history_n_uninstall_the_app_and_remove_all_local_data_n_request_deletion_of_server_side_data_if_used_n_8_changes_to_privacy_policy_n_the_privacy_policy_may_be_updated_as_the_app_evolves_n_continued_use_of_the_app_indicates_acceptance_of_the_updated_policies_n_9_contact_n_if_you_have_any_questions_contact_us_n_dmarketalert_gmail_com_text"
